            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Tamil for a weaver, then the Tamil for a maid."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: தொழிற்சங்கம்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தொழிற்சங்கம் — toḻiṟcaṅkam — \"a trade union\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தொழிற்சங்கம் சம்பள உயர்வு கேட்டது. toḻiṟcaṅkam campaḷa uyarvu kēṭṭatu. The trade union asked for a pay rise."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before ச the final -ல் of தொழில் becomes -ற்: தொழில் + சங்கம் = தொழிற்சங்கம் (toḻiṟcaṅkam)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தொழிற்சங்கம் (toḻiṟcaṅkam) joins the native தொழில் (toḻil), \"a trade\" (DEDR 3524), and சங்கம் (caṅkam), \"an association\", from Sanskrit saṅgha (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
