              "instruction": "toḻiṟcaṅkam campaḷa uyarvu kēṭṭatu. — The trade union asked for a pay rise.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *toḻiṟcaṅkam campaḷa uyarvu kēṭṭatu.* — The trade union asked for a pay rise.]"
